Subject: [PATCH] Docs: wired Xbox 360 and Xbox One pads read over USB

The two switches the pad reader reads, DM_XUSB and DM_XUSB_LOG, are in the switches table, which tests/test_env_switches.py checks against the code. The reference gets an entry in services.md (symptom, cause, fix, limits, found on), the symptom index is regenerated, and the playing page says what the log shows and what such a pad lacks.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#2436
Reason: the pad reader's switches and notes belong in the docs
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1197
---
 docs/playing.md            | 2 ++
 docs/reference/services.md | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

